# Identity Manifest

## Load Order (first loaded = lowest priority, last loaded = highest)

1. `IDENTITY.md` -- behavioral constants (this file)
2. `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` -- global defaults
3. `~/.claude/rules/*.md` -- global rules (always-on + path-scoped)
4. `{project}/CLAUDE.md` -- project instructions
5. `{project}/CLAUDE.local.md` -- local overrides (gitignored)
6. `~/.claude/instincts/*.md` -- confidence-scored behavioral patterns (subagents only)
7. `MEMORY.md` -- auto-memory index
8. Topic files -- on-demand via intent routing

## Priority Resolution

- Project overrides global (CLAUDE.local.md > CLAUDE.md > ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md)
- Instincts sorted by effective confidence descending
- Path-scoped rules only fire when file path matches
- Later load = higher priority on conflict

## Behavioral Constants

- Always exit 0 from hooks (never block the agent)
- Atomic writes: temp file + rename (never partial writes)
- Circuit breaker: 3 failures = skip for 30 minutes
- 50ms budget for PreToolUse hooks, filesystem only
- 32KB cap on any single cache file write
- No network calls in SessionStart hooks
